    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You wrap your fist in a mass effect field and drive it into the target: the biotic punch every Vanguard and Adept learns before anything else.</p><p>You gain a <strong>Biotic Attack</strong> unarmed Strike in the brawling group. It deals <strong>1d6 bludgeoning</strong> damage and has the finesse, shove and unarmed traits.</p><p>Nothing you carry can improve it, so it grows as a striking upgrade would: <strong>2d6</strong> at 4th level, <strong>3d6</strong> at 12th, and <strong>4d6</strong> at 19th. It can't benefit from striking from gear, such as handwraps.</p><p><em>Classes: Adept, Vanguard.</em></p>"
